    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="28">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 28</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XXVIII} Gif mon swa geradne mon ofslea, gif he mægas nage, gielde mon healfne cyninge, healfne þam gegildan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone kills a man in this condition – that is, he has no kin – let him pay half to the king and half to the associates.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a man in this position is slain–if he has no relatives– half the wergeld shall be paid to the king, and half to his associates.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">XXVIII. Gif mon swa geradne mon ofslea, gif he magas nage, gilde man healfne (were þam) cyninge, healfne ðam gegildan.</ab>
      </div>
